    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="36">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 36</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And wise wæran worldwitan þe to godcundan rihtlagan woroldlaga settan, folc to steore, ⁊ Criste ⁊ cyninge gerehtan þa bote þar man swa scolde manega for neode gewildan to rihte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And secular councillors showed wisdom in appointing civil laws to uphold the privileges of religion, for the governance of the people, and in assigning the compensation to Christ and the king, so that thereby many are forced of necessity to submit to justice.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
